of “20.0° API.”.\n[FR Doc. 79-39678 \nFiled 12-26-79; 10:50 am] \nBilling code 3195-01-M\nTHE WHITE HOUSE,  \nD ecem b er 21, 1979.\nEditorial Note: The W hite House statem ent of Dec. 21, 1979, on the decontrol o f heavy oil, is \nprinted in the W eekly Compilation of Presidential Documents (vol. 15, no. 51).\n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_12186.txt","sha256":"3bc5b4b8de8f0d574441fae168ab42ae7cab6f9c99bdff4d0b4cdae43039c930","source":{"line":1662,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"026f1febbed6c48627d974947373efe5ad2cf9a5d5f92e6c5ec1bb4c3034907a"}}]}
